  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.0.777\n\n## Changes since v0.0.769\n\n- VS Code extension: icon and a release-versioned publishing script (#1241) (`0ef9d773`)\n- VS Code extension: warn when the installed CLI lacks language features (#1240) (`5739db54`)\n- Language server: semantic tokens (#1239) (`252f049c`)\n- Ship: vertical shooter ported from the TI-84 Plus CE to every target (#1236) (`c8631803`)\n- Language server: completion and signature help (#1235) (`605e61bf`)\n- Unary - and ~ work on runtime values on every target (#1234) (`ed4489a2`)\n- VS Code extension: highlighting and language server client (#1231) (`b10a6ddf`)\n- Language server: index source libraries and SDKs restored from NuGet (#1233) (`a8497d3f`)\n",
